  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[jsdom](https://www.npmjs.com/package/jsdom) just published its new version 9.6.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Update :rocket:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      jsdom\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      9.6.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **not covered** by your **current version range**.\n\nWithout accepting this pull request your project will work just like it did before. There might be a bunch of new features, fixes and perf improvements that the maintainers worked on for you though.\n\nI recommend you look into these changes and try to get onto the latest version of jsdom.\nGiven that you have a decent test suite, a passing build is a strong indicator that you can take advantage of these changes by merging the proposed change into your project. Otherwise this branch is a great starting point for you to work on the update.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 14 commits .\n- [`7b11f2b`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/7b11f2b72b9fdbbe2946f9e28722ef2c661c50db) <code>Version 9.6.0</code>\n- [`9a98748`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/9a987483bbc7037291acc3f42c367f231a48d27d) <code>Remove test that depends on backbonejs.org</code>\n- [`394b593`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/394b5935b8d2643e53b5f7281b3439d5a10b88b0) <code>Fix copying of attribute namespace prefixes</code>\n- [`f41e7bf`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/f41e7bf466dc35ac136095060957800e36f12837) <code>Update idl conversion script to new webidl2js</code>\n- [`c47eab8`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/c47eab8ca96cd3f2f00a9e2cacb92a2492c6b14a) <code>Implement HTMLCollection @@iterator</code>\n- [`13badf0`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/13badf0b0cec67b50f019442dafe091230a6b9cb) <code>Fixe a spelling mistake</code>\n- [`a6acac4`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/a6acac4e9dec4f859fff22676fb4e9eaa9139787) <code>Add \"jsdom vs. PhantomJS\" to the README</code>\n- [`b3e5970`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/b3e59707561923fecb6edd5112590a90c8f419ab) <code>Update web platform test expectations</code>\n- [`6ddbe2e`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/6ddbe2e23579fd0dcb79c07c99eca3bd268fd5eb) <code>Unset stopPropagationFlags due to latest DOM spec changes</code>\n- [`7088940`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/708894063694f24e1e5305fb8b630cdeda773edf) <code>Update XHR content-type header determination</code>\n- [`dc478dd`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/dc478dd764f92f6cd97c7d5e62287f13f25d3ee6) <code>Send XHR upload loadstart events immediately</code>\n- [`3590d78`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/3590d7883fab6e28b019f1ac25de6e004d9aa8be) <code>Make File's lastModified return the current time as the default</code>\n- [`e4fea5c`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/e4fea5cfd365d4826387536690f4a4d22023aa15) <code>Roll web platform tests</code>\n- [`41fa538`](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/commit/41fa53858c310a5d2632d027ebc010718239de65) <code>Fix spurious ESLint error</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/tmpvar/jsdom/compare/65112fb1664d439d3b3589fdf00e7fc89b6092ae...7b11f2b72b9fdbbe2946f9e28722ef2c661c50db).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
